        "stage": 10,
        "statement": "Flood affects many buildings and roads near the town of St. Regis."
      },
      {
        "stage": 9,
        "statement": "Flooding affects low lying areas adjacent to the river. Minor flooding near the town of St. Regis and several roads in the area may also be flooded."
